      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Decode a data buffer to an Object of type T. This is useful for scenarios,\nthat distinct messages (or events) are decoded and handled individually,\nin fully aggregated form.",
      "translation": "将数据缓冲区解码为类型为 T 的对象。这在需要以完全聚合的形式单独解码和处理不同消息（或事件）的场景中非常有用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>mimeType</code> - the mime type associated with the stream to decode\n(can be <code>null</code> if not specified)",
      "translation": "<code>mimeType</code> - 与要解码的流关联的 MIME 类型（如果未指定，可以为 <code>null</code>）",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
